+  run_command output contains `reason=forced`); check_error submits; SUBMIT FAILED replies; bounces with no later root tool call (incl.
+  budget-end); UNTRACKED-ONLY gate submits = rows where the gate replied SUBMITTED and every section of the scored patch is `new file
+  mode` (only untracked files, dec 072 4b; the stray-files SAFETY metric stays binding). Bounces = cases where the prompt rule alone failed.
+  For v011 all gate counts are "n/a (no gate)".
+- Gate root calls are counted under their actual name `submit_patch` (no rename, D71.1(c)); dec 072 item 5 is satisfied as is.
