Questions for the Director: Does the disclosed additional gate have approval beyond dec 070’s prompt-rule fallback ([008.md:22](/home/ubuntu/work/gemma/eval/plans/008.md:22))? Is deliberate third-call empty submission acceptable under the new “never submit an empty diff on purpose” rule?
